cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "laya-ara-rag: Arabic short-list reranking with laya-multilingual"
message: "If you use this model, please cite it and the evaluation sets you report."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Alkhenizan
    given-names: Mohammad
    website: https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohammad-alkhenizan-537623257
abstract: >-
  laya-ara-rag is a fine-tune of convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual for
  Arabic pairwise relevance and listwise reranking (k≤12). MIRACL-ar
  listwise top-1 rises 0.153 to 0.588 (+284% relative to stock). The mix
  includes in-house Arabic retrieval logs (not redistributed) and a
  MIRACL-ar train replay. XNLI is withheld.
keywords:
  - arabic
  - information-retrieval
  - reranking
  - rag
  - miracl
  - laya
